sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Dev
    participant B as Branch
    participant PR as Pull Request
    participant CI as CI
    participant M as main
    participant H as Render / Vercel

    D->>B: commit feat(backend) ou fix(frontend)
    B->>PR: abre PR focado em uma única pasta
    PR->>CI: lint + testes do app alterado
    CI-->>PR: checks verdes
    PR->>M: merge com aprovação do code owner
    M->>H: deploy apenas do app afetado
